@startuml
' Lecturer Support Agent — editable PlantUML source
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Source Verification and Citation Integrity
participant Orchestrator as AI
participant "Source Discovery" as Search
participant "Metadata Resolver" as Resolve
participant "Evidence Extractor" as Evidence
participant "Claim Validator" as Claims
participant "Source Store" as Store
AI -> Search : query approved sources
Search --> AI : candidates
AI -> Resolve : normalize and resolve metadata/links
Resolve --> AI : valid/invalid candidates
AI -> Evidence : extract relevant evidence
Evidence --> AI : passages/facts
AI -> Claims : proposed claims + evidence
Claims --> AI : supported/rejected mappings
AI -> Store : persist verified source records
Store --> AI : source IDs
note over AI
Only persisted verified source IDs
may be rendered as citations.
end note
@enduml
